					<h1 class="title" title="Kerala Tourism">Cochin Tour</h1>
					<div class="entry-content">
     <p><b>Area:</b> 309.22 km2 
        <img alt="Hill Palace Museum"  class="thumb alignright" title ="Hill Palace Museum" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/Cochin/HillPalaceMuseum.jpg" style="height:150px;width:200px;float:right" /></p>
